WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
My name is Mujere Manue Johnson.

00:02.300 --> 00:05.800
I'm the principal of Tondiwara Schools.

00:05.800 --> 00:08.500
Happy to be here. This was a great invitation.

00:08.500 --> 00:10.800
I loved the session about AI.

00:10.800 --> 00:13.900
We want to thank the facilitators. They were lively.

00:13.900 --> 00:16.600
They had a lot of it. We have discovered much.

00:16.600 --> 00:21.200
I personally learned that a school can actually begin its own AI.

00:21.200 --> 00:25.200
I think it is going to empower us much on research.

00:25.200 --> 00:31.200
And it's not only good for me as an administrator, but equally good for the teachers.

00:31.200 --> 00:35.200
Going forward, we shall conduct a school-based workshop on this,

00:35.200 --> 00:38.700
so we can empower our teachers on how to match modern trends.
